</listitem><listitem><para>Encapsulates a fresh 32-byte shared secret.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Uses the shared secret as an AES-256-GCM wrapping key.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Encrypts the DEK under that wrapping key. Returns the serialised blob described in the class docstring.</para>
